SUMMARY:Tuesday Tastemaker Series: Launch Event TD Music - Choir! Choir! Choir! Opener - DJ Levi
DESCRIPTION:Tuesday Tastemaker Series at Union Summer brings together music lovers\, industry insiders\, and emerging talent for an elevated midweek experience. \nThis is the opening launch for Union Summer\, featuring Choir! Choir! Choir!\, a fully interactive\, participatory show that turns the audience into performers. Expect a high-energy\, joyful experience of singing\, dancing\, and collective music-making with hundreds of music lovers. All voices are welcome\, and no experience is necessary. Since 2011\, directors Daveed Goldman and Nobu Adilman have blurred the lines between performer and audience\, collaborating with artists such as Patti Smith\, David Byrne\, Brandi Carlile\, Rick Astley\, Rufus Wainwright\, and Kermit the Frog\, creating globally recognized performances and viral videos. \nDJ Levi opens the event\, setting the tone with an energetic pre-show set. \nThis program is in partnership with TD Music.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/tuesday-tastemaker-series-launch-event-td-music-choir-choir-choir-opener-dj-levi/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
