SUMMARY:Spotlight on Women: RALPH
DESCRIPTION:Explore a lineup of women in music with a roster of Toronto’s top female talent. \nWith an emphasis on narrative songwriting and genre-bending musical style\, RALPH has created a distinct place for herself within the contemporary music scene. Her sound is catchy but cool\, sexy but smart\, edgy but evocative. She has developed a sonic style that is uniquely her own\, with songs defined by a strong sense of honesty and relatability. Her hit track “Gravity” reached the Top 20 on radio charts\, followed by a JUNO nomination for Dance Recording of the Year in 2020. \nThis program is in partnership with City Hall Live
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/spotlight-on-women-ralph/
