SUMMARY:Best of Union Beats: DJ Dolo in da Cut
DESCRIPTION:We’re bringing our favourite DJs from our indoor Union Beats program to the patio. Turn up your midday with the best beats in the city. Union Summer’s mid-day DJ sessions bring laid-back vibes and feel-good energy to the patio—perfect for a break in the sun. Whether you’re grabbing a bite\, meeting friends\, or just soaking it all in\, our DJs are spinning the ultimate soundtrack to your day. \nDolo in da CUT is a DJ and music producer from Toronto\, Canada. He has performed at major events across North America\, including the grand opening of the Jordan Store in Toronto\, the Moose Knuckles Toronto Flagship Launch\, and Kappa x FootAction at Eaton Centre. His experience also includes exclusive club performances such as 1OAK Las Vegas and two North American tours. In addition to DJing\, he has produced music for Kappa FW19 and Nike SS22 campaigns.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/best-of-union-beats-dj-dolo-in-da-cut/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Summer
