SUMMARY:TGIT: Union Summer
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays just became the new Fridays. Head to Union Summer for a high-energy night featuring Mirvish sing-alongs\, live bands\, and screenings from this summer’s hottest tournament\, bringing fans together. From crowd-pleasing anthems to game-day excitement\, the patio is your go-to spot to kickstart the weekend early—come for the vibes\, stay for everything that makes Thursday the best night of the week. \nStay tuned for artist announcement for this slot. \nThis program is in partnership with Billboard Canada and North.
