SUMMARY:Best of Union Beats: Jordior
DESCRIPTION:We’re bringing our favourite DJs from our indoor Union Beats program to the patio. Turn up your midday with the best beats in the city. Union Summer’s mid-day DJ sessions bring laid-back vibes and feel-good energy to the patio—perfect for a break in the sun. Whether you’re grabbing a bite\, meeting friends\, or just soaking it all in\, our DJs are spinning the ultimate soundtrack to your day. \nJordior is a Toronto-based DJ known for versatile sets that blend house\, hip-hop\, and contemporary club sounds. His performances focus on creating energetic\, crowd-focused experiences built around rhythm\, flow\, and seamless transitions.
