DESCRIPTION:Ease into the weekend with Soul Sessions every Friday night at Union Summer. From smooth R&B and classic Motown to timeless hits across the decades\, our live performers reimagine the songs you love with fresh energy and irresistible groove. It’s a feel-good night of music\, movement\, and nostalgia—guaranteed to get you dancing under the open sky. \nStay tuned for artist announcement for this slot. \nThis program is in partnership with Billboard Canada and North by NorthEast
