SUMMARY:Brunch & Brass: Toronto All Star Big Band
DESCRIPTION:Soak up the sunshine as lively brass ensembles fill the patio with rich\, feel-good sounds—perfectly paired with a relaxed midday bite. It’s a laid-back\, joyful way to gather\, unwind\, and let the music carry you through your Sunday. \nThe Toronto All Star Big Band delivers a powerful\, classic big band sound featuring seasoned musicians from across the city. Known for high-energy performances\, the ensemble brings timeless jazz and big band traditions to life with a modern edge.
