SUMMARY:Rudy Ray Show: Mokupe
DESCRIPTION:Step into the rich\, evolving world of jazz with the Rudy Ray Show at Union Summer. This captivating series explores jazz across the ages\, weaving together timeless traditions and global influences. Each week\, an eclectic mix of musicians brings boundary-pushing sounds in an immersive musical journey that celebrates the artistry\, history\, and soul of jazz. \nTo begin the series\, Mokupe will lead the charge as the opening band\, paying homage to Rudy Ray’s Ghanaian roots through a vibrant live music experience.This program is in partnership with Rudy Ray.
