SUMMARY:Best of Union Beats: DJ Netto
DESCRIPTION:We’re bringing our favorite DJs from our indoor Union Beats program to the patio. Turn up your midday with the best beats in the city. Union Summer’s mid-day DJ sessions bring laid-back vibes and feel-good energy to the patio—perfect for a break in the sun. Whether you’re grabbing a bite\, meeting friends\, or just soaking it all in\, our DJs are spinning the ultimate soundtrack to your day. \nNETTO’s music and brand reflect the diversity of Toronto. He stays active across music production\, event curation\, and international DJ performances\, continually refining his craft and expanding his sound. A Round 13.0 graduate of The Remix Project\, NETTO is part of a creative community dedicated to developing emerging talent in Toronto and Chicago.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/best-of-union-beats-dj-netto/
