DESCRIPTION:Thursdays just became the new Fridays. Head to Union Summer for a high-energy night featuring Mirvish sing-alongs\, live bands\, and screenings from this summer’s hottest tournament\, bringing fans together. From crowd-pleasing anthems to game-day excitement\, the patio is your go-to spot to kickstart the weekend early—come for the vibes\, stay for everything that makes Thursday the best night of the week. \nDJ Battle brings an energetic DJ-led set designed to keep the crowd moving with high-impact transitions and a party-focused atmosphere. \nThis program is in partnership with The Remix Project
